  </span>
  <span class="lc-thumb">
    <img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202307/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma/images/fix-presentation-mistakes-with-gamma-card-01_hu_31b2732656cc6583.webp" width="320" height="320" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
